{"meta":{"id":"file-structure","category":"it/linux/linux-types/ubuntu","title":"파일 구성","subtitle":"(Ubuntu)","summary":"APT/Snap 관련 경로를 포함한 디렉터리 구조","tags":["리눅스","우분투","ubuntu","파일시스템","apt"],"color":"amber","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-files","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-amber-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-orange-50 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-amber-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200/60 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span>\n      우분투 2\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">Linux Basics</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    파일 구성 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-amber-600 font-serif\">(Ubuntu)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-100 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> 표준 FHS 위에 얹힌 APT/Snap 관련 경로 정리\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">핵심 포인트</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">우분투도 표준 FHS를 따르며, 데비안 계열 특유의 경로가 일부 추가됨</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">패키지 저장소/설정은 주로 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">/etc/apt/</code>에 모여 있음</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">Snap 앱은 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">/snap</code>, <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">/var/lib/snapd</code>에 별도로 저장됨</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">주요 디렉터리 구성 & 역할</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">우분투 특화 경로 포함</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[46%]\">구분 및 경로</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-1 text-center w-[20%]\">접근 권한</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[34%]\">핵심 역할</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[APT]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">/etc/apt</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">root</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">저장소 목록(sources.list) 등 APT 설정</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[APT]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">/var/log/apt</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">시스템</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">패키지 설치/업데이트 로그</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-orange-700 bg-orange-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[Snap]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">/snap</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">시스템</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">Snap 패키지 앱 설치 위치</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-violet-700 bg-violet-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[공통]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">/home/사용자명</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">사용자별</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">개인 파일, 바탕화면/앱 설정</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-violet-700 bg-violet-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\">[공통]</span>\n            <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono\">/usr/share</strong>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-center font-bold text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">시스템</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">앱 리소스/문서 등 공용 데이터 저장</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">알아두면 좋은 점</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">dpkg -L 패키지명</code>으로 특정 패키지가 설치한 파일 목록을 확인할 수 있습니다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">앱 바로가기(.desktop 파일)는 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">/usr/share/applications</code> 또는 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">~/.local/share/applications</code>에 위치합니다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">설정 백업 시 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">/etc와 홈 디렉터리의 숨김 설정(~/.config)</strong>을 함께 챙기는 것이 안전합니다.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>Linux Basics Guide</span>\n  <span>Ubuntu</span>\n</div>\n","path":"it/linux/linux-types/ubuntu/file-structure","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"linux","title":"리눅스","path":"it/linux"},{"id":"linux-types","title":"리눅스 종류","path":"it/linux/linux-types"},{"id":"ubuntu","title":"우분투 (Ubuntu)","path":"it/linux/linux-types/ubuntu"}],"hasImage":false}